      "id": "claim_ca69ae54f21b4b4085cee212c0cdb03c",
      "statement": "The PostgreSQL Compose service uses a Compose config (postgres-databases) that installs an executable init script at /docker-entrypoint-initdb.d/databases.sh, which runs only on an empty volume and creates a role, database, and schema for each project listed in POSTGRES_PROJECTS (currently lexico, meanderaw).",
